ompliant job ads without all the back-and-forth</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Employer Branding</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/deel"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/892505534fa65214a67daed2e3032ea8c704b3c5-2881x1463.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Deel" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Deel</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Global Payroll, HRIS, compliance and Hiring via EOR and Contractor services.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HRIS &amp; Payroll</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/deeper-signals"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/52e629e579b9242f6c35bee77bc1dd696e188387-400x262.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Deeper Signals" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Deeper Signals</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Find and grow your top talent faster</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Talent Management</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/docusign"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/0ab58e3fa3db8faa9404d4eae320cf67c94da44d-196x76.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="DocuSign" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">DocuSign</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">DocuSign is a global standard for e-signature, and enables organizations of any size to securely send, sign, track, and store business critical documents directly from the applications they use every day.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">E-Signature</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/dover"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-