nsition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/cecbad0d89761ee16a505c68aa453010396bbb19-196x196.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Handshake" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Handshake</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Recruit smarter, not harder. Need to hire now? Place your job in front of qualified candidates where they are already browsing.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Job Boards &amp; Aggregators</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/heymilo"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/2a2e03e25bcd8862382febc78b22cab903993e77-666x174.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="HeyMilo" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">HeyMilo</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Leading Conversational AI Interviewer that your candidates actually want to interview with</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Video Interviews</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hibob"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/cdda79607f6b4641fbe790c3d38252c0356ca84e-888x357.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Hibob" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Hibob</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">The HR platform that turns people strategies into business success.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HCM</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HRIS &amp; Payroll</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hirematch"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/6a7f9e22c5d7e93419621f5e503bea845231757e-456x462.avif?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Hire Match" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Hire Match</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Undoing the hiring black box</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hire2retire"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/6af3a4dde17b9e1a75e361d0521d46f0c773d868-1000x1000.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Hire2Retire" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Hire2Retire</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Hire2Retire integrates Lever with Identity Providers (IdP), automating profile creation and onboarding workflows to provide a superior “First Day at Work” experience that drives employee retention.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Onboarding</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hiresweet"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="f