.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Sourcing</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hiringkit"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/f108dc6298edb555970d275d043e117379ef10ff-200x200.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="HiringKit" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">HiringKit</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">AI voice screening that calls &amp; qualifies 200 candidates in 2 hours, not 2 weeks</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Video Interviews</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hubspot"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/ec56689d23d55a8e726275d3ea6925f09cc4d918-196x194.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="HubSpot" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semib