ntain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Kombo</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Easily integrate Lever to the rest of your HR stack</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">App Connectors</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/lattice"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/00d84e66ebede263940c8b8007129b860bc9122b-196x50.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Lattice" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Lattice</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Lattice’s integration with Lever allows for mutual Lattice and Lever customers to seamlessly transfer hired candidates from Lever to Lattice.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HRIS &amp; Payroll</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/leoforce"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/590428b1d357e0f537e6a80c92b5c5ecfaec5900-2000x1604.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Leoforce" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Leoforce</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Leoforce provides talent acquisition teams with outcome-based recruiting solutions.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Sourcing</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/linkedin-recruiter"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/237825de374855093df5ad7fbfa6e0a26f5175a5-196x196.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="LinkedIn Recruiter" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">LinkedIn Recruiter</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Lever’s integration with LinkedIn Recruiter lets you export candidates directly from LinkedIn to Lever, so you can spend less time on data entry, and more time sourcing!</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Sourcing</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/mega-hr-inc"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/a7957431ed021388ae69e4567c5277df503c26f0-1596x342.svg?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Mega HR, Inc." class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Mega HR, Inc.</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">10x your Lever productivity, without adding headcount.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Communication</span><span class="text-primary-400 text-xs font-medium">+<!-- -->2</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/metaview"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/ac4a3bfa00ff3287a0520c3f535c7a8d46575c6e-196x29.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Metaview" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold 