ated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Sync2Hire</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">What Slack did for email, we do for your ATS.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Communication</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/talent-llama"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/ba393891358dcca587e9358d8068fbae69f730b2-196x229.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Talent Llama" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Integrated</span></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Talent Llama</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Faster, smarter talent screening through conversational AI. Go beyond the resume and gain a complete understanding of qualified candidates in a fraction of the time.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/talent-io"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-