shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/87467e3f0cc879780e7c3bf622b7800f8efeb1f0-3516x837.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Career.place" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Career.place</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Anonymous candidate screening for inclusive, equitable and efficient hiring.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Diversity &amp; Inclusion</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/checkr"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/e5572b8d94ad052b94721ffe904d72f983c551b4-1110x261.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Checkr" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Checkr</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Checkr is the fastest, most accurate background check solution on the market today.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Background Checks &amp; I9s</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Diversity &amp; Inclusion</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/creative-services-inc"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/df42564fe27531ae1a4627cd9eca71e4197ae384-290x200.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Creative Services, Inc." class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Creative Services, Inc.</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">For more than 50 years, Creative Services, Inc. (CSI) has helped organizations make confident hiring decisions through comprehensive background screening solutions, unmatched quality, and exceptional client and applicant support.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">AI Tools &amp; Technologies</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Background Checks &amp; I9s</span><span class="text-primary-400 text-xs font-medium">+<!-- -->3</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/criteria"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/730a77558f86f2ac8a0c46a12322e43e580164b3-474x162.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Criteria" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Criteria</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Make better talent decisions with evidence-based assessments.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/crosschq"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/fbe0b71858669768784d062ff132a296c40ca598-256x256.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Crosschq" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Crosschq</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Crosschq helps you hire diverse, winning teams through fast, bias-free reference checks.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Diversity &amp; Inclusion</span><span class="text-primary-400 text-xs font-medium">+<!-- -->1</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/direct-employers"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/04557645e2a9e70cc8060f56157374175d5643dc-648x216.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="DirectEmployers" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">DirectEmployers</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Driving Compliance. Powering Partnerships. Elevating Recruitment.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Sourcing</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/ducknowl"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/95536446fb9569dc4ab6e65b1ba970c160e53125-196x168.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Ducknowl" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Ducknowl</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">A video interviewing and assessment platform.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Video Interviews</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/hr-performance-solutions"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/ae2a6f6f120eee90a8a76eca9566a618ba6b2e94-1024x289.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="HR Performance Solutions" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">HR Performance Solutions</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">HRPS helps organizations master areas of performance, learning and compensation management.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Talent Management</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/incruiter"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/c9ef368553d9e936c33b0f707122d7e067e11e4e-512x512.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Incruiter" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Incruiter</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">InCruiter offers AI video interviews, AI phone screening, interview scheduling software, and interview-as-a-service. We want to build a native integration so Lever users can schedule interviews, run automated screenings, and receive candidate assessment reports inside Lever.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Assessments</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Calendars &amp; Scheduling</span><span class="text-primary-400 text-xs font-medium">+<!-- -->3</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/jdp"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/7d03845e1d63c381ab736fa986f71da0ef890518-1300x600.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="JDP" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">JDP</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Prevent Not Safe For Work moments with accurate and timely background checks.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Background Checks &amp; I9s</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/mevitae"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/9480cc7769f73823f214454e5400e1da157d7b81-2396x2698.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="MeVitae" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">MeVitae</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Screen CVs, cover letters, certificates and more with speed and precision, helping you shortlist faster while staying fully compliant with global standards.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/oysterhr"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/5ea97051ff916d3df851b802ac2f0c7958cdc566-600x158.avif?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Oyster HR" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Oyster HR</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Hire, pay, manage &amp; care for full-timers and contractors in 180+ countries</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HRIS &amp; Payroll</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/paylocity"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/e0ea60b0d0e47e8a7fb14edd104e1df3453b8fda-1482x401.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Paylocity" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Paylocity</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Paylocity is the most complete platform for the modern workforce.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HRIS &amp; Payroll</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/puck"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/00c789b2a95e0608839721bab84e665dd4e17e80-790x273.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Puck" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Puck</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Drive candidate quality through employer branding, candidate matching &amp; Talent CRM.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Analytics &amp; Automation</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Employer Branding</span><span class="text-primary-400 text-xs font-medium">+<!-- -->1</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/refapp"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/168720261ffee9a3091a463f53abab07379dbeff-196x196.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Refapp" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Refapp</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Seamlessly perform informative and accurate reference checks on every candidate</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Reference Checks</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/smarthrcheqs"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/f117e913a8d040a59a8df0ffce04c0a19dff2f7a-1822x448.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="SmartHRCheqs" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">SmartHRCheqs</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Comprehensive Background and Drug Screening Solutions</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Background Checks &amp; I9s</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/spark-hire"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/614e1e4732f54bbf5ad4a9320af47f54016a80a4-2842x406.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Spark Hire" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Spark Hire</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Improve your hiring efficiency by 5-7x with Spark Hire’s video interviewing platform.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Video Interviews</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/tavio"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/eb4321bac9bf025d9d1ee4746c4c94770b6fbb92-997x284.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Tavio" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Tavio</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Choose the right applications for you, and tavio will integrate with Lever.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">System Integrators</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/the-encompass-group"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/758276158737bb4bd275337f18e0a71bb8ec122f-2351x538.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="The Encompass Group" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">The Encompass Group</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Optimizing Organizational Performance Through People &amp; Technology</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HCM</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">System Integrators</span><span class="text-primary-400 text-xs font-medium">+<!-- -->2</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/trinet"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/89ce7232dc54c9c552b7680f384f7cdb3810cd75-600x173.avif?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="TriNet" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">TriNet</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Delivers the most comprehensive and modern mobile HR experience.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">HRIS &amp; Payroll</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">RPO/PEO</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/vonq"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><div class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-lg font-bold">V</div></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">VONQ</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">VONQ offers end-to-end recruitment marketing solutions including job distribution tools.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Job Boards &amp; Aggregators</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/voice-by-change-state"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/5ba523e126b067b9f806b47f8eced2e4b736e7e6-1200x543.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Voice by Change State" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Voice by Change State</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Want to know what candidates really think? Send automated experience surveys with Voice.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Employer Branding</span><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Sourcing</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/wotc-com"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><div class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-lg font-bold">W</div></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">WOTC.com</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">WOTC.com is proud to partner with Lever as a leading vendor of the Work Opportunity Tax Credit.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Tax Credits and WOTC</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/wedge"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/74d23a652e544f80bfd904ab55fcf1236f9ec2fb-12262x2577.png?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Wedge" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Wedge</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Authentic one-way video interviewing.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Video Interviews</span></div></article></a><a class="group block h-full" href="/marketplace/providers/yardstik"><article class="hover-lift border-primary-200 flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex h-12 items-center"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/af74c8904faae59f7cbaa0e1e840b14eac29b1f8-196x196.webp?w=400&amp;fit=max" alt="Yardstik" class="h-10 w-auto max-w-[150px] object-contain"/></div></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 group-hover:text-primary-700 mt-4 text-lg font-bold transition-colors">Yardstik</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm">Yardstik makes it possible for businesses to make safer, more comprehensive human security part of any successful operating model</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-4"><span class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-600 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium">Background Checks &amp; I9s</span></div></article></a></div></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="border-primary-100 rela