arding workflows.\",\"categories\":[\"hris-payroll\",\"onboarding\"],\"tier\":\"integrated\",\"providerType\":\"technology\"},{\"_id\":\"mp-lever-ukg-pro\",\"name\":\"UKG Pro\",\"slug\":\"ukg-pro\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/68fd677b87e29463935c830dfd46fac20760b980-544x291.png?w=400\u0026fit=max\",\"shortDescription\":\"The Lever – UKG Pro™ business process automation allows your teams to work together and provide an exceptional candidate and employee experience that spans systems.\",\"categories\":[\"hcm\"],\"tier\":\"integrated\",\"providerType\":\"technology\"},{\"_id\":\"mp-lever-victig\",\"name\":\"VICTIG Background Checks\",\"slug\":\"victig\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/f897cfc7d030112c2309291537a0d46e06322ea4-600x246.png?w=400\u0026fit=max\",\"shortDescription\":\"VICTIG Background Checks is the most innovative and widely integrated pre-employment background check, drug testing, verification and i9 provider in the industry.\",\"categories\":[\"background-checks\"],\"tier\":\"integrated\",\"providerType\":\"technology\"},{\"_id\":\"mp-lever-vanta\",\"name\":\"Vanta\",\"slug\":\"vanta\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/370b1ddf8cfd5dfbd95100b12f60ff159215208a-196x196.webp?w=400\u0026fit=max\",\"shortDescription\":\"Automate compliance. Simplify security. Demonstrate trust.\",\"categories\":[\"analytics-automation\"],\"tier\":\"integrated\",\"providerType\":\"technology\"},{\"_id\":\"mp-lever-veremark\",\"name\":\"Veremark\",\"slug\":\"veremark\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/jc916lw4/production/8456f12dfda1da36866352340d2a4e134568d91e-196x39.webp?w=400\u0026fit=max\",\"shortDescription\":\"Verify the credentials and integrity of existing and prospective employees whilst delivering a best in class candidate experience\",\"categories\":[\"background-checks\"],\"tier\":\"integrated\",\"providerType\":\"technology\"},{\"_id\":\"mp-lever-verified-creden